{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this cozy\u00a0management sim, you run your very own  sushi train restaurant!</strong><br>Get ready to cook up a storm and feed a crowd of hungry customers in a charming, bustling environment. As your cooking skills improve, you\u2019ll unlock new dishes, decorations, and equipment to keep things fresh and exciting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sushi Dojo can be played either fullscreen or at the bottom of your screen as a desktop idler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924070/extras/4c4e6390505c76fe3e2b5fa174f1bcc9.poster.avif?t=1768625034\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924070/extras/4c4e6390505c76fe3e2b5fa174f1bcc9.webm?t=1768625034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924070/extras/4c4e6390505c76fe3e2b5fa174f1bcc9.mp4?t=1768625034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Automation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your conveyor belts ensure every customer gets their meal on time. As your restaurant grows, you\u2019ll need to expand your belt system and start relying on robots and machines to keep up with demand.\u00a0Sushi Dojo is a blend of <strong>cozy vibes and light automation gameplay.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decor &amp; Reviews</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers are patient, but they still notice how you run your business. Serve a wide variety of dishes and decorate thoughtfully to impress critics and keep everyone happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924070/extras/afdfd2d1c6e8050ec33c06f2d48b2378.poster.avif?t=1768625034\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924070/extras/afdfd2d1c6e8050ec33c06f2d48b2378.webm?t=1768625034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924070/extras/afdfd2d1c6e8050ec33c06f2d48b2378.mp4?t=1768625034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Dojo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sensei Mochi faces ever-growing challenges and must continuously sharpen his skills. On his training mat, he can improve his abilities to better handle the demands of the kitchen.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet the Cast</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sensei Mochi</strong> \u2013 A skilled feline head chef who crafts sushi with care and precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shinji</strong> \u2013 A trusty robot assistant who zips around the restaurant, keeping things clean and running smoothly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll guide and assign tasks to both characters as your restaurant grows from humble beginnings into a busy sushi haven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924070/extras/ffc083d9f7894bff1f7627028b12092f.poster.avif?t=1768625034\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924070/extras/ffc083d9f7894bff1f7627028b12092f.webm?t=1768625034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924070/extras/ffc083d9f7894bff1f7627028b12092f.mp4?t=1768625034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3924070?t=1768625034","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3924070?t=1768625034","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924070/96c0b5386095b0118394928f8f4749ea38332e09/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768625034","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924070/96c0b5386095b0118394928f8f4749ea38332e09/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768625034","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this cozy\u00a0management sim, you run your very own  sushi train restaurant!</strong><br>Get ready to cook up a storm and feed a crowd of hungry customers in a charming, bustling environment. As your cooking skills improve, you\u2019ll unlock new dishes, decorations, and equipment to keep things fresh and exciting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sushi Dojo can be played either fullscreen or at the bottom of your screen as a desktop idler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924070/extras/4c4e6390505c76fe3e2b5fa174f1bcc9.poster.avif?t=1768625034\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924070/extras/4c4e6390505c76fe3e2b5fa174f1bcc9.webm?t=1768625034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924070/extras/4c4e6390505c76fe3e2b5fa174f1bcc9.mp4?t=1768625034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Automation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your conveyor belts ensure every customer gets their meal on time. As your restaurant grows, you\u2019ll need to expand your belt system and start relying on robots and machines to keep up with demand.\u00a0Sushi Dojo is a blend of <strong>cozy vibes and light automation gameplay.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decor &amp; Reviews</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers are patient, but they still notice how you run your business. Serve a wide variety of dishes and decorate thoughtfully to impress critics and keep everyone happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924070/extras/afdfd2d1c6e8050ec33c06f2d48b2378.poster.avif?t=1768625034\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924070/extras/afdfd2d1c6e8050ec33c06f2d48b2378.webm?t=1768625034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924070/extras/afdfd2d1c6e8050ec33c06f2d48b2378.mp4?t=1768625034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Dojo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sensei Mochi faces ever-growing challenges and must continuously sharpen his skills. On his training mat, he can improve his abilities to better handle the demands of the kitchen.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet the Cast</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sensei Mochi</strong> \u2013 A skilled feline head chef who crafts sushi with care and precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shinji</strong> \u2013 A trusty robot assistant who zips around the restaurant, keeping things clean and running smoothly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll guide and assign tasks to both characters as your restaurant grows from humble beginnings into a busy sushi haven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924070/extras/ffc083d9f7894bff1f7627028b12092f.poster.avif?t=1768625034\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924070/extras/ffc083d9f7894bff1f7627028b12092f.webm?t=1768625034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924070/extras/ffc083d9f7894bff1f7627028b12092f.mp4?t=1768625034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>","developers":["JOrbits Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924070/afb3f247b6bacf24bee819a10b3fe0dd643df054/header.jpg?t=1768625034","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.9+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or 2,6 GHz Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card with DX9<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3924070/1338373989/d45002885b9dacce4d46ab1f0ed136bb898b0495/1755154608/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755155710","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3924070/1338373989/d45002885b9dacce4d46ab1f0ed136bb898b0495/1755154608/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755155710","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3924070/1338373989/d45002885b9dacce4d46ab1f0ed136bb898b0495/1755154608/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755155710","id":257182993,"name":"Early Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257182993/5552f6ee5354ed3131150fba5526935821930d26/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755